{"seq":1,"slug":"flyway-and-liquibase","title":"Flyway 与 Liquibase 版本化工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/database-migration-patterns/tooling/flyway-and-liquibase","wordCount":1113,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"flyway-与-liquibase-版本化工具\">Flyway 与 Liquibase 版本化工具</h1><p>版本化迁移工具的核心价值是将数据库 schema 变更纳入软件工程的标准流程——版本控制、代码审查、CI 校验、环境隔离。Flyway 和 Liquibase 是这个领域存活最久、用户量最大的两个项目，代表了两种不同的设计哲学：SQL-first（Flyway）vs Changelog-first（Liquibase）。选择哪个取决于团队对「控制力」vs「可移植性」的偏好。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>两者解决的是同一个问题：确保数据库 schema 从任意起始状态，经过一系列有序的变更，到达期望的目标状态——且这个过程是可追踪、可重复、可审计的。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Schema V0 空库] --&gt;|V1: 创建 users 表| B[Schema V1]&#10;    B --&gt;|V2: 添加 email 列| C[Schema V2]&#10;    C --&gt;|V3: 创建索引| D[Schema V3]&#10;    D --&gt;|V4: 拆分 address| E[Schema V4]&#10;&#10;    F[任意新环境] --&gt;|执行 V1→V4| E&#10;    G[生产环境 已在 V2] --&gt;|执行 V3→V4| E\">graph TD\n    A[Schema V0 空库] --&gt;|V1: 创建 users 表| B[Schema V1]\n    B --&gt;|V2: 添加 email 列| C[Schema V2]\n    C --&gt;|V3: 创建索引| D[Schema V3]\n    D --&gt;|V4: 拆分 address| E[Schema V4]\n\n    F[任意新环境] --&gt;|执行 V1→V4| E\n    G[生产环境 已在 V2] --&gt;|执行 V3→V4| E</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>Flyway</th>\n<th>Liquibase</th>\n<th>选型建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>迁移格式</td>\n<td>原生 SQL 文件</td>\n<td>XML/YAML/JSON/SQL changelog</td>\n<td>团队精通 SQL → Flyway</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨数据库</td>\n<td>每种 DB 写对应 SQL</td>\n<td>抽象层自动适配</td>\n<td>多种 DB → Liquibase</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回滚机制</td>\n<td>付费版 undo / 手写补偿</td>\n<td>内建 rollback 指令</td>\n<td>需要自动回滚 → Liquibase</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习曲线</td>\n<td>极低（就是写 SQL 文件）</td>\n<td>中等（需学 changelog 语法）</td>\n<td>快速上手 → Flyway</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态追踪</td>\n<td>flyway_schema_history 表</td>\n<td>databasechangelog 表</td>\n<td>两者等价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CI/CD 集成</td>\n<td>CLI + Maven/Gradle 插件</td>\n<td>CLI + Maven/Gradle + Spring</td>\n<td>两者等价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商业版功能</td>\n<td>团队协作、dry-run、undo</td>\n<td>付费版差异不大</td>\n<td>开源版都够用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"flyway-深入-sql-first-哲学\">Flyway 深入：SQL-First 哲学</h2><p>Flyway 的设计哲学极度简洁：迁移就是 SQL 文件，命名规范就是版本号。不需要学习 DSL，不需要 XML，DBA 和开发者看到的是同一种语言。</p>\n<p><strong>文件命名规范</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"V1__create_users_table.sql          # 版本化迁移（必须按序执行）&#10;V2__add_email_column.sql&#10;V2.1__add_email_index.sql           # 支持小版本号&#10;R__refresh_materialized_views.sql   # 可重复迁移（每次变更都会重新执行）&#10;U2__undo_add_email_column.sql       # 撤销迁移（商业版）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>V1__create_users_table.sql          # 版本化迁移（必须按序执行）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>V2__add_email_column.sql</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>V2.1__add_email_index.sql           # 支持小版本号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>R__refresh_materialized_views.sql   # 可重复迁移（每次变更都会重新执行）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>U2__undo_add_email_column.sql       # 撤销迁移（商业版）</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>执行模型</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 初次使用：建立 baseline&#10;flyway baseline -baselineVersion=1&#10;&#10;# 查看状态&#10;flyway info&#10;# +-----------+---------+---------------------+&#10;# | Version   | State   | Description         |&#10;# +-----------+---------+---------------------+&#10;# | 1         | Baseline| create_users_table  |&#10;# | 2         | Pending | add_email_column    |&#10;# | 2.1       | Pending | add_email_index     |&#10;# +-----------+---------+---------------------+&#10;&#10;# 执行迁移&#10;flyway migrate&#10;# Successfully applied 2 migrations (execution time 00:03.214s)&#10;&#10;# 校验已执行的迁移文件未被篡改&#10;flyway validate\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 初次使用：建立 baseline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">flyway</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> baseline</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -baselineVersion=1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">flyway</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> info</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># +-----------+---------+---------------------+</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># | Version   | State   | Description         |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># +-----------+---------+---------------------+</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># | 1         | Baseline| create_users_table  |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># | 2         | Pending | add_email_column    |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># | 2.1       | Pending | add_email_index     |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># +-----------+---------+---------------------+</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 执行迁移</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">flyway</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> migrate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Successfully applied 2 migrations (execution time 00:03.214s)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 校验已执行的迁移文件未被篡改</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">flyway</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> validate</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Flyway 的 checksum 机制</strong>：每个已执行的迁移文件在 <code>flyway_schema_history</code> 中存储 CRC32 checksum。如果文件被修改（即使只是加了一个空格），<code>flyway validate</code> 会报错。这强制执行「已部署迁移不可变」的契约。</p>\n<p><strong>环境隔离配置</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"properties\" data-code=\"# flyway.conf (per environment)&#10;flyway.url=jdbc:postgresql://prod-db:5432/myapp&#10;flyway.user=${DB_USER}&#10;flyway.password=${DB_PASSWORD}&#10;flyway.locations=classpath:db/migration,filesystem:/opt/migrations&#10;flyway.baselineOnMigrate=true&#10;flyway.outOfOrder=false  # 生产环境禁止乱序执行\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># flyway.conf (per environment)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>flyway.url=jdbc:postgresql://prod-db:5432/myapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>flyway.user=${DB_USER}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>flyway.password=${DB_PASSWORD}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>flyway.locations=classpath:db/migration,filesystem:/opt/migrations</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>flyway.baselineOnMigrate=true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>flyway.outOfOrder=false  # 生产环境禁止乱序执行</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"liquibase-深入-changelog-抽象层\">Liquibase 深入：Changelog 抽象层</h2><p>Liquibase 在 SQL 之上增加了一层抽象——用 changeset 描述「意图」而非具体 SQL，工具根据目标数据库生成对应的 DDL。这带来可移植性，但也增加了学习成本。</p>\n<p><strong>Changelog 格式</strong>（YAML 示例）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"databaseChangeLog:&#10;  - changeSet:&#10;      id: 1&#10;      author: dev-team&#10;      changes:&#10;        - createTable:&#10;            tableName: users&#10;            columns:&#10;              - column:&#10;                  name: id&#10;                  type: BIGINT&#10;                  autoIncrement: true&#10;                  constraints:&#10;                    primaryKey: true&#10;              - column:&#10;                  name: email&#10;                  type: VARCHAR(255)&#10;                  constraints:&#10;                    nullable: false&#10;                    unique: true&#10;      rollback:&#10;        - dropTable:&#10;            tableName: users&#10;&#10;  - changeSet:&#10;      id: 2&#10;      author: dev-team&#10;      preConditions:&#10;        - onFail: MARK_RAN&#10;        - columnExists:&#10;            tableName: users&#10;            columnName: email&#10;      changes:&#10;        - addColumn:&#10;            tableName: users&#10;            columns:&#10;              - column:&#10;                  name: email_verified&#10;                  type: BOOLEAN&#10;                  defaultValueBoolean: false\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">databaseChangeLog</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">changeSet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      author</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">dev-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      changes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">createTable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            tableName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">users</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            columns</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">column</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                  type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">BIGINT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                  autoIncrement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                  constraints</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                    primaryKey</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">column</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">email</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                  type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">VARCHAR(255)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                  constraints</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                    nullable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                    unique</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      rollback</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">dropTable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            tableName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">users</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">changeSet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      author</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">dev-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      preConditions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">onFail</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">MARK_RAN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">columnExists</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            tableName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">users</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            columnName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">email</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      changes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">addColumn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            tableName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">users</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            columns</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">column</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">email_verified</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                  type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">BOOLEAN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                  defaultValueBoolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Liquibase 的差异化优势</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>内建回滚</strong>：每个 changeset 可以声明 <code>rollback</code> 块，<code>liquibase rollbackCount 1</code> 自动执行</li>\n<li><strong>前置条件</strong>：<code>preConditions</code> 可以在执行前检查状态（表是否存在、列是否已添加），实现幂等</li>\n<li><strong>上下文标签</strong>：<code>context: &quot;!production&quot;</code> 让某些 changeset 只在特定环境执行</li>\n<li><strong>diff 能力</strong>：<code>liquibase diff</code> 对比两个数据库生成 changelog（有助于追认手动变更）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"团队协作中的冲突处理\">团队协作中的冲突处理</h2><p>版本化迁移在多人并行开发时最大的摩擦点是<strong>版本号冲突</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 主干&#10;        M1[V5: baseline] --&gt; M2[V6: Alice 的变更]&#10;        M1 --&gt; M3[V6: Bob 的变更]&#10;        M2 --&gt; M4{冲突!}&#10;        M3 --&gt; M4&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 主干\n        M1[V5: baseline] --&gt; M2[V6: Alice 的变更]\n        M1 --&gt; M3[V6: Bob 的变更]\n        M2 --&gt; M4{冲突!}\n        M3 --&gt; M4\n    end</pre><p><strong>Flyway 的处理</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用时间戳命名（<code>V20260702143022__</code>）几乎消除冲突</li>\n<li><code>flyway.outOfOrder=true</code>（仅开发环境）允许乱序执行</li>\n<li>生产环境必须线性——CI 检测分支中的版本冲突</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Liquibase 的处理</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>changeset 用 <code>id + author</code> 唯一标识，不依赖全局序号</li>\n<li>支持多文件 include（按目录组织），减少单文件冲突</li>\n<li><code>validCheckSum</code> 属性允许在必要时更新已执行 changeset 的 checksum</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"与-ci-cd-的集成模式\">与 CI/CD 的集成模式</h2><p>成熟团队的迁移流水线：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[PR 提交迁移文件] --&gt; B[CI: 语法校验]&#10;    B --&gt; C[CI: 在空库重放全部迁移]&#10;    C --&gt; D[CI: 对比生成 schema vs 期望 schema]&#10;    D --&gt; E[CI: 估算执行时间]&#10;    E --&gt; F{时间 &gt; 阈值?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[标记需要在线变更工具]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[标记可直接执行]&#10;    G --&gt; I[Staging 验证]&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; J[生产执行 + 监控]\">graph LR\n    A[PR 提交迁移文件] --&gt; B[CI: 语法校验]\n    B --&gt; C[CI: 在空库重放全部迁移]\n    C --&gt; D[CI: 对比生成 schema vs 期望 schema]\n    D --&gt; E[CI: 估算执行时间]\n    E --&gt; F{时间 &gt; 阈值?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[标记需要在线变更工具]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[标记可直接执行]\n    G --&gt; I[Staging 验证]\n    H --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; J[生产执行 + 监控]</pre><p><strong>关键 CI 检查项</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><code>flyway validate</code> / <code>liquibase validate</code>：文件格式和 checksum 正确</li>\n<li>从空库 <code>flyway migrate</code>：确保迁移链完整可重放</li>\n<li><code>pt-online-schema-change --dry-run</code> 或 <code>gh-ost --test-on-replica</code>：大表变更在 staging 预演</li>\n<li>执行时间预估：<code>EXPLAIN ALTER TABLE</code> 或在测试库实际执行计时</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"atlas-新一代声明式替代\">Atlas：新一代声明式替代</h2><p>Atlas（by Ariga，2022 年发布）代表了版本化迁移工具的新方向——融合声明式 schema 定义与版本化迁移的优点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>用 HCL 声明目标 schema</li>\n<li><code>atlas schema diff</code> 自动生成迁移文件（但开发者可以审查和编辑）</li>\n<li><code>atlas schema apply</code> 执行变更</li>\n<li>内建 linting：检测破坏性变更、建议 expand-contract 分步</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Atlas 适合新项目或愿意重新梳理 schema 管理的团队；已有大量 Flyway/Liquibase 迁移文件的项目迁移成本较高。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Flyway = SQL-first + 极简：适合精通 SQL、单一数据库、追求控制力的团队</li>\n<li>Liquibase = Changelog 抽象：适合多数据库、需要内建回滚、喜欢声明式的团队</li>\n<li>两者都解决同一问题：有序、可追踪、可重放的 schema 版本管理</li>\n<li>CI 集成是版本化迁移发挥价值的关键——仅有工具不够，需要流水线门禁</li>\n<li>Atlas 代表新趋势：声明式 + 版本化的混合模式</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../foundations/migration-versioning\">迁移版本化管理</a>：版本化迁移的理论基础与工程约束</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../microservices-architecture/microservices-data/data-consistency\">微服务数据一致性</a>：微服务场景下每个服务独立管理迁移的一致性挑战</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Flyway 与 Liquibase 版本化工具","id":"flyway-与-liquibase-版本化工具"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Flyway 深入：SQL-First 哲学","id":"flyway-深入-sql-first-哲学"},{"level":2,"text":"Liquibase 深入：Changelog 抽象层","id":"liquibase-深入-changelog-抽象层"},{"level":2,"text":"团队协作中的冲突处理","id":"团队协作中的冲突处理"},{"level":2,"text":"与 CI/CD 的集成模式","id":"与-ci-cd-的集成模式"},{"level":2,"text":"Atlas：新一代声明式替代","id":"atlas-新一代声明式替代"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Dual-Write 与 CDC 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/database-migration-patterns/patterns/dual-write-and-cdc"},"next":{"title":"gh-ost 与 pt-online-schema-change","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/database-migration-patterns/tooling/gh-ost-and-pt-osc"}}